{"verdict": "insufficient",
  "answer": "The evidence shows that RA rapidly induces the immediate early gene IEX-1 in the APL lines NB4 (PML-RARα) and KG1 (PLZF-RARα), via two functional RA-response elements in the IEX-1 promoter, confirming direct transcriptional induction. However, it concerns NB4 and KG1, not DIF2, and never assesses hallmarks of transcriptionally active promoters (e.g., activating histone marks or RNA Pol II occupancy). No evidence about DIF2 or promoter-activity hallmarks is present, so the claim cannot be verified.",
  "evidence_used": ["24624992", "21922424"]}
